# In-source CMake/MSBuild pollution.
# An in-source `cmake` configure scatters these through the tree; the generated
# headers it leaves behind in source include dirs SHADOW the ones in the build
# dir, so builds silently use stale identifiers. Keep them ignored, and delete
# any generated header that turns up inside src/**/include/.
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CMakeCache.txt
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user
*.sln
*.dir/
*.stamp
*.version.rc
/x64/
**/x64/
**/obj/
**/RelWithDebInfo/
**/Debug/
/stamp32/
/version.txt
Generated Files/
*-prefix/

# Dependency fetch/build trees
/_deps/
/_cef/
/vcpkg_installed/
third-party/toolchain.cmake

# Logs
*.log

# Generated into source include dirs by an in-source configure (see above)
src/lib/include/OpenKneeboard/config.hpp
src/lib/include/OpenKneeboard/version.hpp
src/lib/include/VisorVR/config.hpp
src/lib/include/VisorVR/version.hpp
src/app/app-winui3/*-build-time-marker.hpp
data/include/
data/JSSources.cpp
data/JSSources.compressed-embed.json
src/shaders/gen/
src/injectables/*.intermediate.json
src/injectables/*64.def
